 "answer": "The most recent server logs are in the `Ollama` folder under `%LOCALAPPDATA%`, in a file named `server.log`.\n\nThe docs say \"`explorer %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Ollama` contains logs, and downloaded updates\" [ollama/docs/windows.md], and \"_server.log_ contains the most recent server logs\" [ollama/docs/windows.md].\n\n`%LOCALAPPDATA%` usually expands to `C:\\Users\\<your-username>\\AppData\\Local`, so the full path is typically `C:\\Users\\<your-username>\\AppData\\Local\\Ollama\\server.log`. To open the folder, press `Win+R` and enter `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Ollama`.",
